    "created_at": "2020-02-12T10:47:28Z",
    "updated_at": "2020-02-12T10:47:28Z",
    "body": "HTML should at least define infrastructure for `location.reload()` and navigating to the same URL. What UI maps to these is up to the implementation. \"Hard reload\" is mostly a developer-oriented feature that has even less need to be standardized I think and might affect all kinds of things.",
